{"schema":"SDW_SCRIPTURE_CHAPTER_V1","revision":"52add6f41edc5dd9c21f65f02f933fbd1cec266285bee8bce249607475050398","canonicalSourceHash":"f9dfbce6dd2edfe4bb3b4690acd6622f392035be2b0349df98f3607f0a05f6c2","bookId":"engwebu:psa","chapter":95,"verses":[{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":95,"verse_ordinal":1516,"verse_start":1,"verse_end":1,"verse_label":"1","text":"Oh come, let’s sing to the LORD. Let’s shout aloud to the rock of our salvation!","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5213},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":95,"verse_ordinal":1517,"verse_start":2,"verse_end":2,"verse_label":"2","text":"Let’s come before his presence with thanksgiving. Let’s extol him with songs!","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5216},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":95,"verse_ordinal":1518,"verse_start":3,"verse_end":3,"verse_label":"3","text":"For the LORD is a great God, a great King above all gods.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5219},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":95,"verse_ordinal":1519,"verse_start":4,"verse_end":4,"verse_label":"4","text":"In his hand are the deep places of the earth. The heights of the mountains are also his.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5222},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":95,"verse_ordinal":1520,"verse_start":5,"verse_end":5,"verse_label":"5","text":"The sea is his, and he made it. His hands formed the dry land.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5225},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":95,"verse_ordinal":1521,"verse_start":6,"verse_end":6,"verse_label":"6","text":"Oh come, let’s worship and bow down. Let’s kneel before the LORD, our Maker,","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5228},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":95,"verse_ordinal":1522,"verse_start":7,"verse_end":7,"verse_label":"7","text":"for he is our God. We are the people of his pasture, and the sheep in his care. Today, oh that you would hear his voice!","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5231},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":95,"verse_ordinal":1523,"verse_start":8,"verse_end":8,"verse_label":"8","text":"Don’t harden your heart, as at Meribah, as in the day of Massah in the wilderness,","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5236},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":95,"verse_ordinal":1524,"verse_start":9,"verse_end":9,"verse_label":"9","text":"when your fathers tempted me, tested me, and saw my work.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5239},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":95,"verse_ordinal":1525,"verse_start":10,"verse_end":10,"verse_label":"10","text":"Forty long years I was grieved with that generation, and said, “They are a people who err in their heart. They have not known my ways.”","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5242},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":95,"verse_ordinal":1526,"verse_start":11,"verse_end":11,"verse_label":"11","text":"Therefore I swore in my wrath, “They won’t enter into my rest.”","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5246}]}